%% === 4 端到端数据流 ===
sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as BoardView
    participant RPC as 宿主 RPC 通道
    participant H as listIssuesHandler
    participant T as resolveWorkspaceTargets
    participant B as resolveBackend
    participant GH as gh / glab / .deck
    UI->>RPC: useRpc(issuesListRpc)，zod 校验入参
    RPC->>H: 插件进程内调用
    H->>T: 逐个仓库 git remote get-url
    T-->>H: RepoTarget[]（容器工作区往下找一层）
    H->>B: 按目标解析后端
    B->>GH: graphql / api / readBoard
    GH-->>B: 原始票面
    B-->>H: 归一后的票面
    H-->>RPC: 列表 + 计数
    RPC-->>UI: useQuery 缓存 → 渲染
    Note over B,GH: 失败不抛异常：TargetFailure { reason, detail }

%% === 5 事件接入与分流 ===
flowchart TD
    Event["宿主事件（唯一入口）server/hooks.ts"]
    Event --> Create["before agent.create"]
    Event --> End["on agent.turn_ended"]
    Create --> Remote{"有 GitHub / GitLab 远端？"}
    Remote -->|是| Inject["注入 MCP（alwaysLoad，只读进 preapproved）"]
    Remote -->|否| LocalCheck{"存在 .deck/ 或 .scratch/，或设置选了 local？"}
    LocalCheck -->|是| Inject
    LocalCheck -->|否| Skip["不注入"]
    Create -->|任何异常| Pass["记 warn，请求原样放行"]
    End --> Child{"有 parentAgentId？"}
    Child -->|否| Ignore["return（主会话不处理）"]
    Child -->|是| Report["reportEnabledFor(cwd) → TurnReporter.report"]
    Report --> Write["写回父会话 + .deck/handoffs"]

%% === 6 链路时序 ===
sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as 面板
    participant R as RPC handler
    participant W as write.ts
    participant Gh as gh
    participant Api as GitHub
    UI->>R: commentIssue（正文非空、票号正整数）
    R->>W: resolveWritableBackend（GitLab 先查权限 ≥ Reporter）
    W->>Gh: gh api POST .../issues/N/comments
    Gh->>Api: HTTPS
    Api-->>Gh: 响应
    Gh-->>W: 回包
    alt HTTP 4xx（408 除外）
        W->>Gh: 回落 gh issue comment
        Gh-->>W: 成功（无真实时间戳，乐观回填）
    else 5xx / 超时 / 断连
        W-->>R: maybeCreated = true，不重发
    else 2xx
        W-->>R: 成功，乐观回填时间戳
    end
    R-->>UI: 成功 / 「可能已写入，先刷新确认」

%% === 7 状态机 ===
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ready: 打开 · 无人认领 · 无未闭合阻塞
    ready --> claimed: 被指派
    claimed --> ready: 全部解除指派
    ready --> blocked: 新增阻塞者（仍 OPEN）
    blocked --> ready: 阻塞者全关
    claimed --> blocked: 新增阻塞者
    blocked --> claimed: 阻塞者全关且仍有 assignees
    ready --> closed: 关闭 / PR 合并
    claimed --> closed: 关闭 / PR 合并
    blocked --> closed: 关闭 / PR 合并
    closed --> [*]
    note right of closed
        判定顺序：closed → blocked → claimed → ready
        四态互斥；ready + claimed + blocked = open
    end note

